{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"a25a84fb5533d4590596d57c12616d5ba82cba49fe33f036cf507ff02fde2711","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review evals harness (tier-2 replay)","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/plan_review/pass1.py","passes.pass1_chunk","reviewers/plan_review_finder.md","criteria_routing.json","registry.exec_tier","AGENT_TIER","production_batch_runner._resolve_criteria","run_pass1","BatchRunRequest.criteria","tier2.py","verify_findings","pass3_decide","pass3_over_findings","docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/replay/tier2-sample.json","ProductionBatchRunner","Bedrock Opus","coverage.usage.per_criterion"],"problem_keywords":["tier-2 replay","pass-1 criteria","stratified sample","opus bedrock","single-criterion mode","finding verification","verdict comparison"],"propositions":["Tier-2 must replay Pass-1 finders over a fixed stratified sample (~20 review ids with strata for containers, finding counts, store diversity) using frontier Bedrock Opus model.","Single-criterion mode (--criteria flag) constructs single-entry BatchRunRequest.criteria tuple and dispatches via exec_tier to single/agent/container buckets identically to run_pass1, with no forced single-turn override.","Candidate findings must be verified fresh via verify_findings seam and their verdicts computed via pass3_decide/pass3_over_findings, then compared to stored verdicts as flip matrices.","Per-criterion finding sets are compared to stored baseline by norm_id using Jaccard similarity with gained/lost tallies per criterion.","Budget pre-flight validates estimated cost from stored per-criterion usage × current price; 1-TURN/2-STEP criteria capped at $0.25/sample, AGENT-tier priced at production rate."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1788127094809975965,"uuid":"03539cd6-0289-4f47-a884-7ac9c2f1b0a4"}